Native Mark Shot source packages contain three upstream components:

- orig: the exact native Git commit
- orig-vendor: Linux Cargo dependencies selected from the unchanged Cargo.lock
- orig-media: FFmpeg, OpenH264 and nv-codec-headers source files with a SHA-256 manifest

The build does not access the network. Dependency license notices prepared before
the build are in debian/dependency-licenses. debian/source-commit identifies the
upstream revision. Qt source archives and Qt v* release tags are not supported.

Ubuntu 26.04 supplies the Rust >= 1.95 build dependencies needed by Launchpad.
CI pins Rust 1.99.1; packaged builds use the default dynamic CPU OCR feature.
The OCR runtime and models remain explicit user downloads, not build inputs.
